{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21006","headline":"沙路曲 · 李贺","name":"沙路曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳脸半眠丞相树，佩马钉铃踏沙路。\n断烬遗香褭翠烟，烛骑啼乌上天去。\n帝家玉龙开九关，帝前动笏移南山。\n独垂重印押千官，金窠篆字红屈盘。\n沙路归来闻好语，旱火不光天下雨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}